  "fullDescription": "Warm up the holiday season with Bold and Easy Cozy Christmas Coloring Book, a printable collection made for relaxed, stress-free coloring. This book includes 50 coloring pages with thick, clear outlines and simple shapes, so it is a comfortable fit for beginners, children, adults and seniors who like a calm creative break.\n\nInside you will find cheerful winter scenes such as smiling snowmen with scarves and hats, a decorated Christmas tree, a cozy snow globe with a little cabin and pine trees, hot cocoa with a candy cane, wrapped presents, snowflakes and more. Every page has plenty of open space, which makes coloring easy with crayons, colored pencils, markers or gel pens.\n\nThe book also comes with 16 unique cover designs, so you can choose the cover that matches your style, whether you are printing for home, classroom, church group, care center or a holiday party.\n\n📄What is included:\n50 coloring pages with bold, easy line art\n16 unique book cover designs\nHigh resolution files for sharp printing\nInstant digital download, print as many times as you need\n\nWhy you will love it:\nLarge, simple designs that are easy to color\nGreat for kids, adults, seniors and beginners\nPerfect for rainy days, Christmas break, family time and holiday gatherings\nWorks well as a quiet activity, a gift idea or a classroom activity\nPrint at home on standard paper and start coloring right away\n\nThis Christmas coloring book is also a lovely choice for teachers, parents and caregivers looking for a screen-free holiday activity that brings a cozy, festive mood to any room.\n\nPrint it, grab your favorite colors and enjoy a peaceful, merry coloring session.",
